{"asset_key":"ep7/gameplay_story_17600050","episode":"ep7","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"17600050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:1:1760005001:0":{"text":"After a good night's rest, you arrive at the Sunseek Arena on time...","source_cn":"休息一夜后，你们按时抵达了残阳武斗场……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDFB276C33C729557","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"After a good night's rest, you arrive at the Sunseek Arena on time...","female":"After a good night's rest, you arrive at the Sunseek Arena on time...","variant_male_record_index":"236670","variant_female_record_index":"236671","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1760005002:1":{"text":"Welcome to the Trial of Courage! Give me a shout, my old friends!","source_cn":"曼卡拉的老朋友们，欢迎来到勇气试炼的现场！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB791F1C060DC6C38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1760005003:0":{"text":"Today's challenger is Agumon, the breakout rookie who stunned us all with his astonishing strength!","source_cn":"今天的挑战者是——初次亮相就展现出惊人战斗力的怪物新人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4DD746928701BEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1760005004:0":{"text":"This little warrior will be up against...","source_cn":"而这位小勇士，即将在试炼中面对的敌人是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x397B2AF89880977D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1760005005:0":{"text":"Brutus, our legendary God of War!","source_cn":"荒角沙漠的战神，布鲁特斯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17B10075F40D25A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1760005006:0":{"text":"I look forward to facing you, Agumon.","source_cn":"我很期待和你的比试，亚古兽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA990C3B1364C140","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1760005006":{"text":"I look forward to facing you, Agumon.","source_cn":"我很期待和你的比试，亚古兽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA990C3B1364C140","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1760005007:0":{"text":"Heh, surprise! That's exactly the reaction I was hoping for!","source_cn":"嗯哼哼，是不是很惊讶！就是要这个效果！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3F8776F55FA67C3E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Heh, surprise! That's exactly the reaction I was hoping for!","female":"Heh, surprise! That's exactly the reaction I was hoping for!","variant_male_record_index":"236677","variant_female_record_index":"236678","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1760005008:0":{"text":"I simply told Brutus about Agumon, a star in the making...","source_cn":"其实很简单啦！我向布鲁特斯隆重介绍了亚古兽，这位蛮血部...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3300042767F09294","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1760005009:0":{"text":"Of course, I had to promise a few extra things to sweeten the deal, but that's beside the point... Anyway, the God of War has graced us with his presence!","source_cn":"——当然，还有更多私下里的请求和其他行动！这些略过不提...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85D0E28F31F348C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1760005010:0":{"text":"The Trial of Courage is no joke! A proper fight like this is what I, Mikola, live for!","source_cn":"这才是真正的勇气试炼——这才是我，曼卡拉，最喜欢的热闹...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E86890876A5A97F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:16:1760005011:0":{"text":"The Mauler spectators erupt in cheers. Meanwhile, Taichi and Agumon use the brief moments before the battle to plan their strategy...","source_cn":"蛮血们欢呼喝彩。而亚古兽与太一也利用着短暂的赛前时间，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB2AF3B219FD84DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1760005012:0":{"text":"That guy's as big as Leomon, so I'm guessing he's just as strong.","source_cn":"体型像狮子兽一样大，估计战斗能力也不会比狮子兽弱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00CE0CB56667E069","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1760005013:0":{"text":"But if you Digivolve into Wargreymon, we should have no problem prevailing!","source_cn":"但只要进化成战斗暴龙兽，就一定能赢！加油啊，亚古兽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AA31D0F07B7A4C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1760005014:0":{"text":"Great!","source_cn":"嗯！<key:dialog182>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD9682F4C4D3DD5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1760005015:0":{"text":"The trial begins now!","source_cn":"我宣布，勇气试炼正式开始！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74D74C99BBDA12FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:25:1760005016:0":{"text":"As the horn blares, Brutus makes the first move, swinging his giant sword at Agumon.","source_cn":"号角声响起，布鲁特斯率先使出数招压迫感十足的攻击，挥动...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C549E6048A67CCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1760005017:0":{"text":"Agumon, Digivolve!","source_cn":"亚古兽！进化吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC081B2CAA85EC25C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:29:1760005018:0":{"text":"At the most critical moment, Taichi's Digivice and Crest of Courage fail to respond.","source_cn":"但面临如此危机的情况，神圣数码机与勇气徽章却没有任何反应","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86A846E1AD4714FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1760005019:0":{"text":"Why... can't I Digivolve?","source_cn":"为什么……不能进化？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB85667CFA9CF105","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1760005020:0":{"text":"Watch out!","source_cn":"——危险！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79CE8F1E883A8393","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1760005021:0":{"text":"Taichi lunges forward, shielding Agumon from Brutus' strike. Seeing this, Brutus frowns and stops his attack.","source_cn":"太一飞扑上前，将亚古兽压在身下，堪堪躲过了这一击。看到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7BDDF0B00BF3751","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1760005022:0":{"text":"Taichi, what's wrong with your Crest of Courage?","source_cn":"太一，亚古兽！这是怎么回事，为什么勇气徽章没有反应？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B29C0BA7B1F35B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:40:1760005022":{"text":"Taichi, what's wrong with your Crest of Courage?","source_cn":"太一，亚古兽！这是怎么回事，为什么勇气徽章没有反应？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B29C0BA7B1F35B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1760005023:1":{"text":"How could this happen?","source_cn":"什么……怎么会这样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3F2328C46736F92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1760005024:1":{"text":"Get out of the arena, Taichi and Agumon! If you can't Digivolve to Wargreymon, you're no match for Brutus!","source_cn":"太一，亚古兽，快点回来！没有勇气徽章和战斗暴龙兽，和他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2258871E66CA0EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1760005025:1":{"text":"But, what about Gabumon...","source_cn":"但是，加布兽——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CB70F3E0DFDE16A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1760005026:1":{"text":"We'll find another way! It might take longer, but at least you two will be safe!","source_cn":"我们换一种方法找加布兽就是了！虽然可能会慢一点，但总比...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41BC979D5882A974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1760005027:1":{"text":"I know you're worried about Gabumon, Yamato! You couldn't even sleep last night!","source_cn":"大和，但你很担心加布兽不是吗？昨天晚上担心到甚至睡不着觉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA493221A1A15E783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1760005028:1":{"text":"... But...","source_cn":"……可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40AF24964A7ADF56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1760005029:1":{"text":"You don't seem ready for the trial.","source_cn":"看来，你们还没有做好进行勇气试炼的准备。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EF40147174FADFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1760005030:1":{"text":"Let's end the match here.","source_cn":"这场比试，到此为止吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FC47924822584CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1760005031:1":{"text":"Hold on!","source_cn":"等一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x607EE84845380818","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1760005032:0":{"text":"Taichi, I want to give it a try!","source_cn":"太一，我还是想要接受勇气试炼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86FF5A189C6DBFF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1760005033:0":{"text":"If we give up so easily, how are we supposed to face the Dark Masters when we return to the Digital World?","source_cn":"如果在这里就退缩的话，就算能回到数码世界，也没办法战胜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDA4E8C959B90B05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1760005034:0":{"text":"Also... this is our best chance to find Gabumon...","source_cn":"而且……如果现在放弃的话，就再也找不到加布兽了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC1CC83C982E1BD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1760005035:0":{"text":"You're right, Agumon! Brutus may be huge, but that also means he has more weak points! I'm sure we can beat him and find Gabumon!","source_cn":"亚古兽，虽然对方体型很大，但相对破绽也会更多。我们一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE42A43B37FF74FD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1760005036:1":{"text":"Good. Looks like Mikola was right about you. Your courage is admirable, youngsters.","source_cn":"好。看来这次，曼卡拉没有夸大。新生代，你们的勇气值得敬佩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACE1EC1DC7D8E48D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1760005037:1":{"text":"Now, come forward and defeat me! Let me see that courage in action!","source_cn":"继续试炼吧！走上前来，战胜我。向我证明，你们的实力是否...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C70E5509183E32D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:40:0:1":{"text":"It should be the effect of dimensional distortion.","source_cn":"或许是时空扭曲造成的影响","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x967A8C82E1A2BAC4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It should be the effect of dimensional distortion.","female":"It should be the effect of dimensional distortion.","variant_male_record_index":"91563","variant_female_record_index":"91564","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"Brutus?!","source_cn":"布鲁特斯？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE5CF3B2C7DFD01F4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Brutus?!","female":"Brutus?!","variant_male_record_index":"91559","variant_female_record_index":"91560","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"How on earth did you convince Brutus to come?!","source_cn":"你是怎么请来布鲁特斯的？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9AB72B85244D232D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"How on earth did you convince Brutus to come?!","female":"How on earth did you convince Brutus to come?!","variant_male_record_index":"91561","variant_female_record_index":"91562","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_femal